        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWCHM, Newport Rosette With Crystal Chambord Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOften times traditional decor is seen as simplistic and familiar but Grandeur's Chambord Knob With Newport Rosette changes that. The crystal knob is a sparkling reminder of the old world; and when paired with the simple rope rose, the beauty of this crystal door knob is allowed to shine as the main focus. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWCHM Newport Rosette With Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Newport Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Chambord Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Rosette With Crystal Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Chambord Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Chambord Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWCHM-specifications.pdf?v=1704262183\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur NEWCHM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Newport Rosette With Chambord Knob, Grandeur NEWCHM",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWCHM, Newport Rosette With Crystal Chambord Knob - Often times traditional decor is seen as simplistic and familiar but Grandeur's Chambord Knob With Newport Rosette changes that. The crystal knob is a sparkling reminder of the old world; and when paired with the simple rope rose, the beauty of this crystal door knob is allowed to shine as the main focus. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
